<p>I share these sentiments.</p>
<p>The &quot;corporealization&quot; tech was interesting, and in line with some other reality anchoring tech various authors have headcanon-ed up (I'm thinking of Xyank/Anastasakos Constant Temporal Sinks as the best possible example) without going full Ghostbusters. But eventually, that hook wasn't enough, and a block of empty text with a strange reveal drained my interest entirely.</p>

